Package: xios-native
Name: Xios Desktop (Native iPadOS)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xios-core, xios-launcher-tools, com.max.xiosprefs
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0.0
Description: the native iPadOS flavor for Xios
 Linux desktop apps as first-class iPadOS windows. There is no Linux shell
 in this flavor: each app gets its own home screen icon and its own iPadOS
 window, and Split View and Slide Over take the place of a desktop
 environment.
 .
 Installs the launcher sync tools, ioscd launch daemon, per-app host payload,
 and the Settings app pane used to choose which desktop apps appear on the
 Home Screen. App icons appear next to your iOS apps; tap one and the app
 opens like any other iPad app.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.0 or newer on a rootless jailbreak (/var/jb).
